Lemme explain why I'm negatively rating this game:
Pros
- cool artwork;
- cool chars;
- funny dialogues;
- some good puzzles;
- good environment details;
- co-op
Cons
- many easy as f*** puzzles;
- unbalanced chars (you can easily do the level without either Pontius or Amadeo but Zoya is too good);
- unscrollable (with mouse wheel) level choice which can lead to (as it happened to me before I rage quit) mis-level-selection or worse;
- UNSKIPPABLE CUTSCENES!!!
- some minor bugs
But really, the unskippable cutscenes are too much to bare, specially if you choose to play in hardcore mode

